Number: 295
Solution-Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1933-10_105/page/n26/mode/1up


###WHIRLPOOL###
#SCHEME#AVAILS#
#PRIMP#PRETZEL#
COATS#BEANS#NAP
OOZE#FORDS##IVE
UKE#PROSE#SLEEP
RY#PIANO#OPENS#
T#CONTENTMENT#M
SCOUTS#ARENA#SA
